  "details": "Api is returning a string for currentAvatarTags for mutuals when only one tag is set instead of a array, breaking deserialisation\n\n{\n\n\"avatarThumbnail\": \"X\",\n\n\"currentAvatarTags\": \"author_tag_wife,author_tag_spider\",\n\n\"debugflag\": \"1\",\n\n\"displayName\": \"X\",\n\n\"id\": \"X\",\n\n\"instance\": \"private\",\n\n\"instanceType\": \"\",\n\n\"isRejoining\": \"0\",\n\n\"platform\": \"standalonewindows\",\n\n\"profilePicOverride\": \"X\",\n\n\"status\": \"ask me\",\n\n\"travelingToInstance\": \"private\",\n\n\"travelingToWorld\": \"private\",\n\n\"userIcon\": \"X,\n\n\"world\": \"private\"\n\n}\n\n2025.11.11 04:01:44 Error      -  [API] An error occurred filling the model ApiMutualFriend: Error writing the following fields: avatarThumbnail, currentAvatarTags, debugflag, isRejoining\n\n2025.11.11 04:01:44 Error      -  [API] ApiMutualFriend: could not write currentAvatarTags of type String[]\n\nIndex was outside the bounds of the array.\n\n2025.11.11 04:01:44 Error      -  [API] ApiMutualFriend: could not write groups of type String[]\n\nIndex was outside the bounds of the array.\n\n2025.11.11 04:01:44 Error      -  [API] An error occurred filling the model ApiMutualFriend: Error writing the following fields: currentAvatarTags, groups\n\n2025.11.11 04:01:44 Error      -  [API] TryWriteConvert: Unable to use Convert.ChangeType to convert from a string to String[]\n\n2025.11.11 04:01:44 Error      -  [API] ApiMutualFriend: Could not write property due to decoding failure, wanted SystemString[] for currentAvatarTags",
